[Computer Weekly] Government-backed open property initiative enters new phase — &lt;p&gt;The Centre for Finance, Innovation and Technology (CFIT) has moved its open property project to the next phase, with real-world cases to be tested.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;After completing roadmaps on developing open finance, digital ID, and small and medium-sized enterprise (SME) access to finance, the government-backed CFIT moved its focus on open property a year ago.&lt;/p&gt; 
